---
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
---
<div class="mkt-architecture">
  <div class="mkt-architecture-entry"><span class="mkt-micro">YOUR APPLICATION</span><span class="mkt-architecture-entry-code">A URL. A profile. One API call.</span><Icon name="down" size={20}/></div>
  <div class="mkt-architecture-layers">
    <article class="mkt-engine-card"><div class="mkt-layer-heading"><span class="mkt-layer-icon"><Icon name="route" size={22}/></span><span class="mkt-micro">01 / ACCESS ENGINE</span><span class="mkt-tag">HTTP API</span></div><h3>The right route.<br/>An inspectable result.</h3><p>Explicit proxy class and country, approved destination profiles, retained responses and durable request keys.</p><div class="mkt-layer-endpoint"><span>POST</span><code>/v2/fetch</code></div></article>
    <article class="mkt-engine-card"><div class="mkt-layer-heading"><span class="mkt-layer-icon mkt-icon-cyan"><Icon name="layers" size={22}/></span><span class="mkt-micro">02 / BROWSER WORKFLOWS</span><span class="mkt-tag">REVIEWED RECIPES</span></div><h3>When a page<br/>needs a browser.</h3><p>Reviewed recipes for browser rendering, interactions and source-specific challenge handling on your project’s v1 gateway.</p><div class="mkt-layer-endpoint"><span>POST</span><code>/v1/fetch</code></div></article>
    <article class="mkt-engine-card mkt-proposed-layer"><div class="mkt-layer-heading"><span class="mkt-layer-icon"><Icon name="grid" size={22}/></span><span class="mkt-micro">03 / INTELLIGENCE LAYER</span><span class="mkt-tag mkt-tag-preview">PROPOSED</span></div><h3>More context.<br/>Less guesswork.</h3><p>A proposed layer for route suggestions, source diagnostics and extraction guidance, building on the access engine.</p><div class="mkt-layer-endpoint mkt-proposed-endpoint"><span class="mkt-dot"></span> PRODUCT DIRECTION</div></article>
  </div>
  <div class="mkt-architecture-base"><Icon name="lock" size={15}/><span>Project isolation</span><i></i><span>Spending reservations</span><i></i><span>Durable idempotency</span><i></i><span>Encrypted captures</span></div>
</div>
